# Model weights are large and reproducible: the official ones come from
# `make models`, and the Turkish fine-tunes from `make model-turkish` /
# `make model-buzz`. Keeping them out of the repository keeps it clonable.
#
# This file is itself tracked, so the folder exists on a fresh checkout and the
# program has somewhere to put them.
*.bin
*.bin.part
*.gguf
